# External crates of a fixture workspace, in the form of
# scripts/crate-boundaries.external.
emulation: thiserror (run): error enums
emulation: sha2 (run): hashes
emulation: cfg-if (run): sha2's conditional compilation
emulation: toml (run): a format, through the neutral media
emulation: serde (run): toml's data model
emulation: memchr (run): run through toml, also used by a derive macro
emulation: thiserror-impl (build): thiserror's derive macro
emulation: proc-macro2 (build): token streams for the derive macro
emulation: serde_derive (build): serde's derive macro
emulation: version_check (build): sha2's build script
emulation: fastrand (test): a test dependency of device
pc: winit (run): PC host crates are not limited by the list
